          "value": "xywh=pixel:3261.890625,450.32269287109375,2619.5908203125,3736.9619750976562",
          "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/"
        }
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto, right side",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>the governors, the &scaron;\u0101dds and the government employees are mistreating them and are requisitioning</li>\n<li>their ships, with the result that their merchandise is being lost, for they are dumping it</li>\n<li>on the isolated seashores where it cannot be protected,</li>\n<li>and this is causing disruption to their trade</li>\n<li>and their ruin; and (since it has been reported) that fishermen from outside this province</li>\n<li>living in the province of al-al-\u0120arbiyya are fishing along the shores</li>\n<li>of the lake in the said province and all this is causing</li>\n<li>damage to the \u1e0d\u0101mins and to the finances of the d\u012bw\u0101n - he was displeased with all</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 1
    },
    {
      "etag": "\"6d000ed4eea7f39f5597fee6745b6800\"",
